+  targets_limit: |
+    Every job_name can optionally cap the number of its own active scrape targets via the
+    max_scrape_targets `ScrapeConfig` option, falling back to the -promscrape.maxTargetsPerJob
+    global flag default (0 on both means unlimited). The resolved limit is baked into every
